ASTA Studio 1.1.0 (20 November 2026)

* New Statistics button with MATLAB-labelled time/frequency tables.
* Adds signed static error, maximum/minimum sampled output and DC magnitude in dB.
* Inspect current and saved designs, choose precision, and export full-precision CSV.
* Shows sampling context, outdated results, unstable loops and frequency-boundary peaks.
* Keyboard-accessible, responsive dialog distinguishes T peak, Mr, Tp and rise time.

ASTA Studio 1.0.0 (19 November 2026)

* First installable GNU Octave package.
* pkg load astastudio exposes the browser workspace and numerical API.
* astastudio launches the workspace; astastudio('test') runs the full self-test.
* Includes the existing browser UI, bounded caches, examples, and 19 plant models.
* Native Qt UI and binary .asta project APIs remain available.
